OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after tyres damaged on five
OL,4,Apolice vehicles
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after five
OL,7,Fpolice vehicles and a parked car near a
OL,8,Fpolice station had their tyres damaged.
OL,10,FHampshire & Isle of Wight police said
OL,11,Fin total 13 tyres on the vehicles
OL,12,Fparked on the street on Station Street
OL,13,Fin Ryde were damaged on Friday at about
OL,14,F23:00 BST.
OL,16,FThe force said leaving the vehicles
OL,17,Ftemporarily out of action "had a
OL,18,Fsignificant impact on our ability to
OL,19,Frespond to incidents and serve our
OL,20,Fcommunities".
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
