OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after tyres damaged on five
OL,4,Apolice vehicles
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 27-year-old man from Newport was
OL,7,Farrested on suspicion of criminal
OL,8,Fdamage. He has since been bailed until
OL,9,F18 January while inquiries continue.
